3:This document provides a complete technical reference for the **`swegemma`** evaluation harness and its companion libraries (**`adk-submission`** and **`adk-eval-core`**). It explains how competitor submissions are validated and compiled, how the harness orchestrates agent sessions and sandboxes, how the built-in tools behave, and how generated patches are extracted and graded.
